{"seq":26,"slug":"ai-agent-frameworks","title":"AI Agent 框架与平台","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":4,"docCount":14,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks","rating":{"composite":3.82,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":2.75,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.67,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"ai-agent-框架与平台-简介\">AI Agent 框架与平台 简介</h1><p>AI Agent 框架与平台是构建智能代理系统的核心基础设施。随着大语言模型能力的飞速提升，如何将模型能力转化为可落地的智能代理应用，成为当前 AI 工程化的关键课题。本知识库系统梳理了主流 Agent 框架的设计理念、核心架构与生产实践，帮助读者从零到一构建可靠的智能代理系统。</p>\n<p>本知识库适用于具备一定 LLM 基础知识的中高级开发者，包括正在评估或使用 Agent 框架的后端工程师、AI 应用开发者，以及关注多智能体协作模式的架构师。</p>\n<p>全书共分为四章，系统覆盖从单体框架到多智能体协作、从工具集成到生产部署的完整链路。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>LangChain 生态</strong>，深入讲解当前最流行的 Agent 框架 LangChain 的核心抽象，包括链式调用、智能体模式、工具集成机制，以及新一代图编排引擎 LangGraph 的设计哲学与实践方法。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>多智能体框架</strong>，聚焦 CrewAI、AutoGen 等新兴多智能体协作平台，解析角色分工、任务分配与智能体间通信的核心模式，帮助读者理解何时以及如何从单智能体迈向多智能体架构。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>工具集成</strong>，系统讲解智能体与外部世界交互的关键技术，涵盖函数调用协议、MCP 协议、工具编排策略，以及如何构建和注册自定义工具，赋予智能体真正的行动能力。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>生产部署</strong>，围绕智能体系统从实验到生产的关键挑战展开，涵盖监控与可观测性、规模化部署策略，以及智能体安全防护等核心议题。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径为：先通过第一章掌握 LangChain 生态的核心概念和编程范式，再通过第三章理解工具集成的底层机制，之后进入第二章探索多智能体协作模式，最后通过第四章完成生产化落地的知识储备。已有 LangChain 使用经验的读者可直接从第二章或第三章开始阅读。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"langchain-ecosystem","title":"LangChain 生态","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/langchain-ecosystem","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"langchain-overview","title":"LangChain 框架全景","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/langchain-ecosystem/langchain-overview"},{"seq":2,"slug":"chains-and-agents","title":"链与代理模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/langchain-ecosystem/chains-and-agents"},{"seq":3,"slug":"langchain-tools","title":"LangChain 工具系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/langchain-ecosystem/langchain-tools"},{"seq":4,"slug":"langgraph","title":"LangGraph 状态化工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/langchain-ecosystem/langgraph"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"multi-agent-frameworks","title":"多智能体框架","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/multi-agent-frameworks","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crewai","title":"CrewAI 多代理协作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/multi-agent-frameworks/crewai"},{"seq":2,"slug":"autogen","title":"AutoGen 对话式多代理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/multi-agent-frameworks/autogen"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-agent-patterns","title":"多代理协作模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/multi-agent-frameworks/multi-agent-patterns"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"tool-integration","title":"工具集成","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/tool-integration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"function-calling","title":"Function Calling 机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/tool-integration/function-calling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mcp-protocol","title":"MCP 协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/tool-integration/mcp-protocol"},{"seq":3,"slug":"tool-orchestration","title":"工具编排与调度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/tool-integration/tool-orchestration"},{"seq":4,"slug":"custom-tools","title":"自定义工具开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/tool-integration/custom-tools"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"production-deployment","title":"生产部署","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/production-deployment","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"agent-monitoring","title":"Agent 监控与可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/production-deployment/agent-monitoring"},{"seq":2,"slug":"scaling-agents","title":"Agent 扩展与性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/production-deployment/scaling-agents"},{"seq":3,"slug":"agent-security","title":"Agent 安全工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-frameworks/production-deployment/agent-security"}]}]}